# Selenium
- Use page objects + components; prefer verified `data-qa` / stable CSS/XPath.
- Wait with `WebDriverWait` + `ExpectedConditions` (no `Thread.sleep` / `TimeUnit.sleep` in tests).
- Obtain `WebDriver` only via `UiBaseTest.page()` / `SessionFactory` — never `new ChromeDriver()` in tests.
- Dismiss AE overlays via `BasePage.dismissOverlaysIfPresent()` when needed.
